    "title": "User Guide",
    "is_authoritative": true,
    "body": "<div>\n            \n  <div class=\"section\">\n\n<aside class=\"admonition seealso\">\n<p class=\"first admonition-title\">See also</p>\n<p class=\"last\">if you’re a developer who’s already familiar with Zotonic, you may want to\nread the <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_index#developer-guide\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">Developer Guide</span></a> instead.</p>\n</aside>\n<p>Welcome to the Zotonic User Guide. This guide is a non-technical introduction to\nZotonic.</p>\n<p class=\"rubric\">Table of contents</p>\n<div class=\"toctree-wrapper compound\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_userguide_cms\">CMS</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_userguide_datamodel\">The Zotonic data model</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_userguide_user_management\">User management</a></li>\n<li class=\"toctree-l1\"><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_userguide_issues_and_features\">Issues and features</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<aside class=\"admonition-todo admonition\">\n<p class=\"first admonition-title\">Todo</p>\n<p class=\"last\">Add more chapters to have a complete run-through of all user-facing aspects\nof Zotonic.</p>\n</aside>\n<p>See <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"http://zotonic.com/support\">http://zotonic.com/support</a> for getting help and support.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n           </div>",
